cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use py-harness (formerly python-vibe) or quote a measured score, please cite it.
type: software
title: py-harness
abstract: >-
  A laptop Python vibe-coding kit. The model proposes; a deterministic
  harness decides what ships. Daily work is an 8B local model. The public
  0.5B LoRA is a style prior.
authors:
